<given-names>FF</given-names></name><name><surname>Prado</surname><given-names>PI</given-names></name><name><surname>Manfio</surname><given-names>GP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Investigation of bacterial diversity in Brazilian tropical estuarine sediments reveals high actinobacterial diversity</article-title><source>Antonie Van Leeuwenhoek</source><year>2004</year><volume>86</volume><fpage>317</fpage><lpage>328</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15702384</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s10482-005-0162-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Watve</surname><given-names>MG</given-names></name><name><surname>Gangal</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Problems in Measuring Bacterial Diversity and a Possible Solution</article-title><source>Appl Environ Microbiol</source><year>1996</year><volume>62</volume><fpage>4299</fpage><lpage>4301</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16535456</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Culley</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name><name><surname>Zhang</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Predicted highly expressed genes in the genomes of <italic>Streptomyces coelicolor </italic>and <italic>Streptomyces avermitilis </italic>and the implications for their metabolism</article-title><source>Microbiology</source><year>2005</year><volume>151</volume><fpage>2175</fpage><lpage>2187</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16000708</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1099/mic.0.27833-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Arakawa</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Tomita</surname><given-names